/* Help. */
"Help.01" = "De'wI' tetlhDaq «poSmoH…» yIwIv pagh ⌘O yI'uy. ngutlh tu'qom polmeH Daqvo' ngutlh tu'qom DapoSmoHlaH. ngutlh tu'qom De' app DeghDaq pagh poSbogh jIHHomDaq yIqeng. ngutlh tu'qom De'mey poSmoHmeH app motlhmoHlu'meH Glyph Atlas yIwIv. qen DapoSmoHbogh ngutlh tu'qom poSmoHqa'meH «qen DapoSmoHbogh ngutlh tu'qom poSmoH» yIwIv.";
"Help.02" = "De'wI' tetlhDaq «ngutlh tu'qom paqDaq latlh chenmoH» yIwIv. lo'wI' ngutlh tu'qom polmeH DaqDaq jIHHomvamDaq poSbogh ngutlh tu'qom latlh chenmoHlu'. Hoch lo'wI'pu' ngutlh tu'qom polmeH DaqDaq latlh DachenmoHmeH, ⌥ yI'uytaH 'ej «Hoch lo'wI'pu'vaD latlh chenmoH» yIwIv.";
"Help.03" = "ngutlh tu'qom choHlaHbogh DapoSmoHDI', jIHHom leQmey retlhDaq SeHlaw mach 'anglu'. SeHlaw yIqeng; vaj poStaH. mI' DawIvDI', mI' DachoHmeH ↑/↓ pagh ⇧↑/⇧↓ yIlo'.";
"Help.04" = "Deghmey DaleghmeH, retlh tetlhDaq wa' ngutlh pagh ngutlhmey law' yIghItlh. tlhegh chu' DachenmoHmeH ⌥⏎ yI'uy. ghItlh DapolmeH pagh ghItlh pollu'ta'bogh Dalo'meH, nIH leQ yI'uy 'ej «ghItlh pollu'ta'bogh» yIwIv. ghItlh pollu'ta'bogh DaQaw'meH, De'wI' tetlhDaq ⌥ yI'uytaH. ghItlhmey luqawlu'bogh DachoHmeH, ⇥ pagh ⇧⇥ yI'uy.";
"Help.05" = "Degh motlh Daqa'meH 'ej latlh Deghmey DaleghmeH, DeghDaq 'eQway' leQ cha'logh yI'uy pagh Degh yIwIv 'ej ⏎ yI'uy. Degh DachelmeH, bIvangtaHvIS ⇧ yI'uytaH.";
"Help.06" = "Deghmey DawIvmeH ↑/↓ yI'uy. Deghmey motlh DawIvmeH ⌥↑/⌥↓ yI'uy. Degh tetlhDaq Degh wa'DIch pagh Degh Qav DawIvmeH ⌘↑/⌘↓ yI'uy.";
"Help.07" = "Unicode DeghDaq 'eQway' yIratlhmoH; vaj Unicode ngutlh pong DaleghlaH. rarchuq DawIvbogh Degh, Unicode ngutlhmey je. Hoch rarchuqbogh Unicode ngutlhmey latlh DachenmoHmeH ⌘C yI'uy.";
"Help.08" = "nIH leQ yI'uy 'ej leghmeH mIw yIwIv. «wa' Degh» DawIvmeH ⌘1 yI'uy; «ngutlhmey» DawIvmeH ⌘2 yI'uy; «Degh tetlh» DawIvmeH ⌘3 yI'uy. retlh Da'angmeH pagh DaSo'meH ⌃⌘S yI'uy.";
"Help.09" = "⌃⌘G yI'uy; «He ghoS» yIchu' pagh yIchu'Ha'. He ghoS chu'lu'DI', wa' Degh DaleghmeH ngutlhmey pagh Degh tetlhDaq DeghDaq 'eQway' leQ cha'logh yI'uy. tlhopDaq DuvmeH pagh DacheghmeH ⌘] ⌘[ je tIlo'; chegh leQ Dalo'laH je. qawHaq DaleghmeH chegh leQDaq nIH leQ yI'uy pagh leQ yI'uytaH.";
"Help.10" = "latlh Deghmey DaleghmeH, ngutlhmeyDaq Degh yIwIv. SaSbogh ghItlh pagh chongbogh ghItlh DawIvmeH, nIH leQ yI'uy pagh ⌘5 yI'uy. ghItlh Daq, ngutlh tu'qom DuHmey je naDev tu'lu'. latlh DuHmey ngaS De'wI' tetlh «legh».";
"Help.11" = "ghItlhDaq Degh DachelmeH, Degh tetlhDaq DeghDaq 'eQway' leQ cha'logh yI'uy. retlh tetlhDaq Degh DawIvDI', Degh tetlhDaq bar Degh. «DuH lo' 'ej Deghmey QIb» Datu'meH nIH leQ yI'uy.";
"Help.12" = "ghItlh DatInmoHmeH pagh DamachmoHmeH ⌘+/⌘− yIlo', pagh 'echlet HabDaq cha' nItlh tISummoH pagh tIHopmoH. ngutlhmeyDaq HeHmey DatInmoHmeH pagh DamachmoHmeH ⌥⌘+/⌥⌘− yIlo', pagh SaSbogh lurghDaq cha' nItlh tISummoH pagh tIHopmoH; tlheghmey joj DatInmoHmeH pagh DamachmoHmeH ⌃⌘+/⌃⌘− yIlo', pagh chongbogh lurghDaq cha' nItlh tISummoH pagh tIHopmoH. ghItlh tIntaHghach motlh DacheghmoHmeH ⌘0 yI'uy.";
"Help.13" = "veH 'aplo' 'ang QIb. Degh juchtaHghach, Degh 'abtaHghach, tlhegh 'abtaHghach, tlheghmey joj je 'ang. veH 'aplo' Da'angmeH pagh DaSo'meH ⌘4 yI'uy.";
"Help.14" = "HurghlaH jIH. Degh chImbe' DawIvDI', mInlIj DuQlaH Degh wov; jul rur! «rItlh» tetlhDaq Degh rItlh, veH 'aplo' QIb rItlh, 'em rItlh je DachoHlaH. DachoHta'bogh rItlh DapolmeH «DaH rItlh tetlh pol» yIwIv. «rItlh tetlh Qaw'» Datu'meH ⌥ yI'uytaH.";
"Help.15" = "DaH Dalo'bogh DuHmey, rItlhmey, ghItlh tIntaHghach, jIHHom tIntaHghach je DapolmeH, De'wI' tetlhDaq «DuHmeyvam pol 'ej motlhmoH» yIwIv. ngutlh tu'qom De'mey DapoSmoHDI', DuHmeyvam lulo'lu'. «DuHmey motlh cheghmoH» DawIvmeH ⌥ yI'uytaH.";
